## Why This Is Asked
Real-world federated privacy requires strict budget governance and data locality to satisfy regional compliance and tenant SLAs, while still enabling global analytics.

## Key Concepts
- Differential privacy budgets per tenant and per region
- Data locality constraints and secure regional processing
- Auditable, tamper-evident logs and rollback paths
- Lightweight per-tenant APIs for budget, policy, and audits

## Code Example
```javascript
// Simple DP budget ledger update (conceptual)
function adjustBudget(tenant, epsDelta, deltaNotes){
  const rec = getBudget(tenant);
  rec.epsilon += epsDelta;
  rec.delta += deltaNotes?.delta || 0;
  saveBudget(tenant, rec);
  return rec;
}
```

